sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>80 or 443/TCP<br/>HTTP(S)
    participant Proxy as Router Proxy<br/>8080/TCP<br/>HTTP (Envoy)
    participant EPP as Router EPP<br/>9002/TCP<br/>gRPC (ext-proc)
    participant Decode as Decode Model Server<br/>8000/TCP<br/>HTTP (vLLM)
    participant Prefill as Prefill Model Server<br/>8000/TCP<br/>HTTP (vLLM)
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>P/D Disaggregation
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP<br/>HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Standard Inference Request
        Client->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS at Gateway (if configured)
        GW->>Proxy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080 (cluster internal)
        Proxy->>EPP: ext-proc filter<br/>gRPC/9002 (localhost)
        Note right of EPP: EPP selects optimal backend<br/>(prefix-cache-aware,<br/>load-aware routing)
        EPP-->>Proxy: Selected endpoint
        Proxy->>Decode: Inference request<br/>HTTP/8000
        Decode-->>Proxy: Prediction result
        Proxy-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,Sidecar: Flow 2: Prefill/Decode Disaggregated Serving
        Client->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions
        GW->>Proxy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080
        Proxy->>EPP: ext-proc filter<br/>gRPC/9002
        EPP->>Prefill: Route to prefill server<br/>HTTP/8000
        Note right of Prefill: Prefill computes KV cache<br/>for input tokens
        Prefill->>Decode: KV cache transfer<br/>NIXL (RDMA/TCP)
        Sidecar->>Decode: Route decode request<br/>HTTP/8000
        Decode-->>Proxy: Generated tokens
        Proxy-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>Client: Streamed response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Decode,HF: Flow 3: Model Weight Download (Startup)
        Decode->>HF: GET model weights<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer (HF_TOKEN)
        HF-->>Decode: Model artifacts
        Prefill->>HF: GET model weights<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer (HF_TOKEN)
        HF-->>Prefill: Model artifacts
    end
